<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Definitions_PA-192.3-green-fleet-performance-compliance-safety-and-analytics" targetNamespace="https://erpplans.local/bpmn" exporter="erpplans generate-bpmn.py" exporterVersion="1.0">
    <bpmn:process id="W_W5481" name="W5481. Fleet GHG Emissions Measurement, MRV &amp; Scope 1 Reduction Reporting" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Baseline established (W5465); monthly/quarterly/annual ESG reporting cycle
Frequency: Monthly measurement; quarterly/annual reporting
Volume: Whole owned fleet + 3PL-attributable share (per W5485)
Owner: ESG/Sustainability Manager (VS-25)
Participants: Fleet (VS-06), Fuel (VS-61), Charging Ops (W5473), Finance (VS-17.4), External assurance (VS-21)
Source: workflow W5481 — Fleet GHG Emissions Measurement, MRV &amp; Scope 1 Reduction Reporting</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5481_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5481_Lane1" name="ESG Analyst">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5481_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5481_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5481_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5481_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5481_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5481_Lane2" name="ESG">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5481_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5481_End10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5481_Start4" name="Baseline established (W5465); monthly/quarterly/annual ESG reporting cycle">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5481_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5481_Task5" name="Aggregate activity data per GHG Protocol Scope 1: diesel/gasoline litres…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Aggregate activity data per GHG Protocol Scope 1: diesel/gasoline litres (VS-61), biodiesel/LNG/CNG (W5478), and the residual liquid-fuel share of the owned fleet; capture electricity kWh for EV charging separately (Scope 2, per W5479 renewable-share).
Responsible (R): ESG Analyst
Accountable (A): ESG/Sustainability Manager
Duration: monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5481_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5481_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5481_Task6" name="Apply emission factors (Philippine/IEA grid EF for electricity; fuel-specific…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Apply emission factors (Philippine/IEA grid EF for electricity; fuel-specific EF for liquids; certified lifecycle EF for biodiesel per W5478) consistently with the corporate GHG inventory methodology.
Responsible (R): ESG Analyst
Accountable (A): ESG/Sustainability Manager
Duration: per cycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5481_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5481_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5481_Task7" name="Compute actual tCO₂e vs the decarbonization target (W5465) and the ex-ante…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Compute actual tCO₂e vs the decarbonization target (W5465) and the ex-ante baseline (W5471); attribute reductions to electrification, alt-fuel, eco-driving (W5476), and route redesign (W5472).
Responsible (R): ESG Analyst
Accountable (A): ESG/Sustainability Manager
Duration: per cycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5481_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5481_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5481_Task8" name="Report into the corporate ESG/Scope-1 disclosure (VS-25 W694/W1334) and any…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Report into the corporate ESG/Scope-1 disclosure (VS-25 W694/W1334) and any voluntary framework (GHG Protocol, TCFD/ISSB, CDP); support external assurance (VS-21).
Responsible (R): ESG / Finance
Accountable (A): ESG/Sustainability Manager
Duration: annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5481_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5481_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5481_Task9" name="Maintain MRV evidence (activity-data records, EF sourcing, calculations)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Maintain MRV evidence (activity-data records, EF sourcing, calculations) audit-ready; reconcile to the fuel/energy financial records (VS-61/VS-17).
Responsible (R): ESG Analyst
Accountable (A): ESG/Sustainability Manager
Duration: ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5481_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5481_End10" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5481_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5481_Annotation11">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-808 (ensure controlled execution — Green Fleet Performance, Compliance, Safety &amp; Analytics (PA-192.3).) | - operational: documented GHG Protocol methodology; conservative-EF policy; external assurance for public disclosure.
Owner: ESG/Sustainability Manager (VS-25)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W5481_Assoc12" sourceRef="W5481_Annotation11" targetRef="W5481_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W5481_Flow13" sourceRef="W5481_Start4" targetRef="W5481_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W5481_Flow14" sourceRef="W5481_Task5" targetRef="W5481_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W5481_Flow15" sourceRef="W5481_Task6" targetRef="W5481_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W5481_Flow16" sourceRef="W5481_Task7" targetRef="W5481_Task8" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W5481_Flow17" sourceRef="W5481_Task8" targetRef="W5481_Task9" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W5481_Flow18" sourceRef="W5481_Task9" targetRef="W5481_End10" />
    </bpmn:process>
