      <bpmn:userTask id="W5484_Task6" name="Deliver EV/alt-fuel driver training: eco-driving for range (links W5476)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Deliver EV/alt-fuel driver training: eco-driving for range (links W5476), charging discipline, HV-safety basics, emergency response, and towing/strand protocol; certify before EV assignment.
Responsible (R): Fleet Training / OEM
Accountable (A): Fleet Training &amp; Enablement Lead
Duration: per driver</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5484_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5484_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5484_Task7" name="Deliver EV-specific maintenance technician training and HV-qualification (per…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Deliver EV-specific maintenance technician training and HV-qualification (per OEM + DOLE-OSH) certifying safe HV-work (links W5480/W5483); re-certify periodically.
Responsible (R): Fleet Training / OEM
Accountable (A): Fleet Training &amp; Enablement Lead
Duration: per technician</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5484_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5484_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5484_Task8" name="Operate the eco-driving incentive program (rewards/ recognition for top kWh/km…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Operate the eco-driving incentive program (rewards/ recognition for top kWh/km and L/100km performers per W5476) and coach under-performers (links VS-124).
Responsible (R): Fleet Ops / L&amp;D
Accountable (A): Fleet Training &amp; Enablement Lead
Duration: monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5484_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5484_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5484_Task9" name="Maintain competency/certification records in the L&amp;D/HR system (VS-19.4) and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Maintain competency/certification records in the L&amp;D/HR system (VS-19.4) and gate vehicle/HV-work assignment on valid certification (links W5480/W5483).
Responsible (R): L&amp;D / Fleet Training
Accountable (A): Fleet Training &amp; Enablement Lead
Duration: ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5484_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5484_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5484_Task10" name="Refresh content on regulatory change, OEM updates, new drivetrains, and lessons…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Refresh content on regulatory change, OEM updates, new drivetrains, and lessons learned from incidents (W5483) and analytics (W5488).
Responsible (R): Fleet Training / HSE
Accountable (A): Fleet Training &amp; Enablement Lead
Duration: per change</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5484_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
