    <bpmn:process id="W_W5485" name="W5485. Third-Party / 3PL Carrier Green-Fleet Requirements, Contract Clauses &amp; Scorecard" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: 3PL/ carrier contracting (VS-56/VS-110); RFP; annual carrier review
Frequency: Per contract/RFP; annual scorecard
Volume: ~80% of the outbound-distribution fleet is third-party (VS-06); plus last-mile (VS-56)
Owner: Freight Procurement &amp; Carrier Manager (VS-110/VS-56)
Participants: Carriers/3PLs, TPRM (VS-161), ESG (VS-25), Legal (VS-100)
Source: workflow W5485 — Third-Party / 3PL Carrier Green-Fleet Requirements, Contract Clauses &amp; Scorecard</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5485_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5485_Lane1" name="Freight Procurement">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5485_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5485_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5485_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5485_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
