        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-808 (ensure controlled execution — Green Fleet Performance, Compliance, Safety &amp; Analytics (PA-192.3).) | - operational: carrier TPRM with emissions-data evidence; phased green expectations; material-claim attestation requirement; scorecard-in-allocation policy.
Owner: Freight Procurement &amp; Carrier Manager (VS-110/VS-56)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
