    <bpmn:process id="W_W5486" name="W5486. EV Charging Billing, Electricity Cost Allocation, Reimbursement &amp; Home-Charge Policy" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Charging sessions (W5473); electricity billing; reimbursement cycle
Frequency: Per billing cycle; monthly cost allocation
Volume: Per fleet-charging session + any off-site/home/depot-charging reimbursement
Owner: Logistics Finance Analyst (VS-17.4/VS-158)
Participants: Fleet (VS-06), Facilities/Energy (VS-120), Treasury (VS-18), drivers, Finance (VS-17)
Source: workflow W5486 — EV Charging Billing, Electricity Cost Allocation, Reimbursement &amp; Home-Charge Policy</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5486_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5486_Lane1" name="Logistics Finance Analyst">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5486_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5486_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5486_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5486_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5486_Lane2" name="Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5486_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5486_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5486_End10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5486_Start4" name="Charging sessions (W5473); electricity billing; reimbursement cycle">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5486_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5486_Task5" name="Allocate depot/site charging electricity cost to the fleet cost center per…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Allocate depot/site charging electricity cost to the fleet cost center per vehicle/session using session logs (W5473): kWh × tariff, including demand-charge apportionment and renewable-share (W5479).
Responsible (R): Logistics Finance Analyst
Accountable (A): Finance Controller
Duration: monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5486_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5486_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5486_Task6" name="Where drivers charge off-site (depot of a 3PL, public network, or home for…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Where drivers charge off-site (depot of a 3PL, public network, or home for take-home vehicles), define and operate the reimbursement policy: evidence (session receipt), rate, cap, and tax/RA-10173 handling.
Responsible (R): Finance / Fleet
Accountable (A): Finance Controller
Duration: per cycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5486_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5486_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5486_Task7" name="Reconcile utility electricity bills (VS-120) to the session-log total to detect…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Reconcile utility electricity bills (VS-120) to the session-log total to detect leakage (un-billed sessions, metering gaps) and recover/refund.
Responsible (R): Logistics Finance Analyst
Accountable (A): Finance Controller
Duration: monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5486_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5486_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5486_Task8" name="Feed accurate per-vehicle electricity cost into the TCO model (W5469) and the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Feed accurate per-vehicle electricity cost into the TCO model (W5469) and the freight/fleet cost accounting (VS-158/VS-61).
Responsible (R): Logistics Finance Analyst
Accountable (A): Finance Controller
Duration: monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5486_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5486_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5486_Task9" name="Maintain VAT/treatment compliance on electricity and any reimbursement (links…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Maintain VAT/treatment compliance on electricity and any reimbursement (links VS-79) and cost-allocation governance across entities (VS-72).
Responsible (R): Finance / Tax
Accountable (A): Finance Controller
Duration: ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5486_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5486_End10" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5486_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
