        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-808 (ensure controlled execution — Green Fleet Performance, Compliance, Safety &amp; Analytics (PA-192.3).) | - operational: reimbursement cap and evidence policy; documented cross-entity allocation keys.
Owner: Logistics Finance Analyst (VS-17.4/VS-158)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
