      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Program live; monthly/quarterly performance review; annual strategy (W5465)
Frequency: Monthly analytics; quarterly/annual review
Volume: Whole program — owned fleet + 3PL + charging/alt-fuel
Owner: Fleet Analytics &amp; Continuous Improvement Lead (VS-133/VS-06)
Participants: ESG (VS-25), Finance (VS-17.4/W5469), OpEx (VS-133), Fleet Ops (W5473/W5477)
Source: workflow W5488 — Green Fleet Performance Analytics, Decarbonization Tracking &amp; Continuous Improvement</bpmn:documentation>
